      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T05:59:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is \"CROS_FWID\" used for? What\u0027s the advantage of adding it to zephyr vs. just dropping the \"CROS_FWID_MISSING\" string and calling it good?",
      "revId": "842a1ff6b82f2d13685bc9860b6564ac111985ea",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8533133c_335a3b07",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 13,
      "author": {
        "id": 1390635
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T20:11:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The motivation is to make it easier for developers to correlate an EC firmware with a ChromeOS build version and to align with how AP FW is versioned. Most developers find `board_14497.0.22_02_08` to be more useful than `board_v2.0.11715-7254d0bfe2`",
      "parentUuid": "738aa1bd_fcbf0229",
      "revId": "842a1ff6b82f2d13685bc9860b6564ac111985ea",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cd9bd7a6_2db618aa",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 13,
      "author": {
        "id": 1330845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T20:17:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should it replace our existing version string then instead of augmenting it?\n\nMy goal here is to not have two things called \"FWID\".",
      "parentUuid": "8533133c_335a3b07",
      "revId": "842a1ff6b82f2d13685bc9860b6564ac111985ea",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3ef819fb_566517b7",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 13,
      "author": {
        "id": 1390635
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T22:08:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMO yes. The concern is the long tail of tools and tests that depend on the existing version format. We can pull the band-aide if you think it\u0027s worth it.",
      "parentUuid": "cd9bd7a6_2db618aa",
      "revId": "842a1ff6b82f2d13685bc9860b6564ac111985ea",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
