      "message": "technically the date could have changed between when you started the test and when the version string gets generated.\n\nso the test should mock the `datetime.date.today` function to return a fixed date.\n\nyou then won\u0027t need the string formatting here either (the expected header will now be a fixed constant).\n\nyou can see the fixture `fake_date` above for an example on doing the mock",
