      "message": "using None (the default) is fine, since you\u0027re only checking presence of the environment variable\n\nalthough be careful ... do we want to support CHROMEOS_OFFICIAL\u003d0 turning it off? In which case you need to check for that value specifically, as the environ contains strings, and \"0\" is truthy.",
