        "id": 1330845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T05:59:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "note that the project_name can already be found in the EC version string (called \"FRID/FWID\"), so duplicating it here likely provides little value. Since you\u0027re limited to 31 chars, we might want to save those precious letters.",
      "range": {
